NP.TXT:
high efficiency cogeneration means cogeneration meeting the criteria of Annex III to Directive 2004/8/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council
OJ L 52, 21.2.2004, p. 50. and satisfying the harmonised efficiency reference values established by Commission Decision 2007/74/EC
OJ L 32, 6.2.2007, p. 183.;
